WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.280
Editing day.

00:00:01.280 --> 00:00:05.070
Some comparing words are already right, so leave them alone.

00:00:05.070 --> 00:00:06.750
Look for two mistakes.

00:00:06.750 --> 00:00:10.100
One is doubling up, like more louder.

00:00:10.100 --> 00:00:14.790
The other is an adjective doing an adverb’s job, like moved quicker.

00:00:14.790 --> 00:00:18.130
Fix those, then read the sentence out loud to check.
